Package: parkeze-lan
Depends: ucode, ucode-mod-fs, ucode-mod-uci, dnsmasq-full, firewall4, nftables-json, kmod-nft-nat
Maintainer: Joseph Telaak <joseph@parkeze.com>
Architecture: all
Description: The devlan zone: ports for devices this gateway serves.
 DHCP and DNS with per-device reservations, NAT out whichever uplink is
 routing, clients isolated from each other, the console and the management
 tunnel, and a per-client egress policy of Parkeze only or the internet. Counts
 each client's traffic per uplink, and opens the one kind of forward a gateway
 makes: from the management tunnel to one client's port, for a bounded time.
 For boards that set PARKEZE_LAN_PORTS; see boards/common/board.conf.
